GFOpenTorrent: no Windows resources for the console's and the About box's
icons. Windows loads ICO_TERMINAL and AppIcon from resources.rc; on
AmigaOS that gave an error box at start ("Failed to load image from file
ICO_TERMINAL"), so both come from the toolkit's wxArtProvider. The
console's stray printf goes too. Under __WXOPENLAYOUT__, Windows' code as
it was.
